# Weekly review: mark rent done, push slides out, star Home, move the inbox call to Home, then reschedule in Today and undo/redo there.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write quarterly report @due({today-2})
	- Review pull requests
	- Prepare slides @due({today+1})
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
	- Pay rent @due({today-7})
END
keys G x
see ✔ Pay rent
keys k k k } } }
keys j s
keys gg j gm
see Move to
type home
keys <Enter>
see ▌   - Call the plumber
keys gt
see Today
see - Write quarterly report  Work
keys j W
hide Write quarterly report
keys z
see ▌ - Write quarterly report  Work
keys Z
hide Write quarterly report
keys j .
see ▌   ✔ Pay rent
keys H
see Today
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write quarterly report @due({today+1})
	- Review pull requests
	- Prepare slides @due({today+4})
Home: @star
	- Fix the shelf
	- Pay rent @due({today-7}) @done({today})
	- Call the plumber
END
